  "summary": "The MPC cycles a heating plant (burner/valve or district steam) on outdoor temperature. From the BMS, read the system and outdoor temperatures and the output and system relays; adjust the day/night heat adjustments, cutoffs or system setpoint, and force a day/night shift if needed.",
